#16EC06"></circle></svg><div class="lp-stress-move"><b>THE MOVE</b><p>走八分钟。然后静坐四分钟。</p></div></div><div class="lp-stress-out"><article><h3>FAT</h3><p>皮质醇下来，脂肪才会掉</p></article><article><h3>HRV</h3><p>恢复准时，HRV 才会涨</p></article><article><h3>SLEEP</h3><p>负荷下来，夜晚才会变长</p></article></div></section><section class="lp-science" id="science"><div><p class="lp-kicker-lime">关于表盘</p><h2 class="lp-display-title">每一张表盘<br/>都是生成的。</h2><p class="lp-science-lede">只有一块屏。模型自己画出表盘——一个环、一条抬升曲线、昨晚的睡眠、一格电。数字留在手腕上。这块屏上没有任何一样东西来自模板。</p><p class="lp-science-legal">适用于 18 岁以上人群。HOOP 不是医疗器械，不做心电图，也不做诊断。</p><p class="lp-science-ticker">LINE · DAYS · RING · SLEEP · FUEL · HEAT · BATTERY · GAUGE · ZONES</p></div><div class="lp-faces"><div class="lp-faces-row"><article class="lp-face"><div class="lp-face-k">TRAINING LOAD · TODAY</div><div style="align-items:center;display:flex;gap:20px;padding-top:16px"><svg width="152" height="152" viewBox="0 0 152 152" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="19.8" y="99" width="12" height="12" fill="#26262E"></rect><rect x="13.5" y="82.9" width="12" height="12" fill="#26262E"></rect><rect x="12.2" y="65.7" width="12" height="12" fill="#26262E"></rect><rect x="16" y="48.8" width="12" height="12" fill="#26262E"></rect><rect x="24.7" y="33.8" width="12" height="12" fill="#26262E"></rect><rect x="37.3" y="22.1" width="12" height="12" fill="#26262E"></rect><rect x="52.9" y="14.6" width="12" height="12" fill="#26262E"></rect><rect x="70" y="12" width="12" height="12" fill="#EFF65A"></rect><rect x="87.1" y="14.6" width="12" height="12" fill="#EFF65A"></rect><rect x="102.7" y="22.1" width="12" height="12" fill="#EFF65A"></rect><rect x="115.3" y="33.8" width="12" height="12" fill="#EFF65A"></rect><rect x="124" y="48.8" width="12" height="12" fill="#EFF65A"></rect><rect x="127.8" y="65.7" width="12" height="12" fill="#EFF65A"></rect><rect x="126.5" y="82.9" width="12" height="12" fill="#EFF65A"></rect><rect x="120.2" y="99" width="12" height="12" fill="#EFF65A"></rect><rect x="109.5" y